","female":"I think so, too!","variant_male_record_index":"124929","variant_female_record_index":"124930","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1120774012:0":{"text":"But you decide, Chak. I'll follow you anywhere.","source_cn":"不过……奇克可以慢慢考虑。卢玛会听奇克的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05EA5F0D680E382E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1120774013:0":{"text":"Because you've always taken good care of me.","source_cn":"因为奇克是个好大哥！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x83DFA5572572357E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1120774014:0":{"text":"Don't worry. Even if I do return to the Claws, it'll be to make them change their ways and make up for the past!","source_cn":"放心吧，就算我真的要回流沙之爪，也是为了改变他们，让他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF8E39E49FC435F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1120774018:0":{"text":"I'm just glad we've finally managed to make up for some of our past mistakes.","source_cn":"至于现在嘛……我们总算成功弥补了一些过错。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7627E0549D7220E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1120774019:0":{"text":"... Come on, Rumon! Let's go celebrate with the others!","